        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "\"Unlock Your Inner Peace with UniMed+.\n\nDive into a transformative journey with our meditation app that harnesses the power of Solfeggio frequencies. Designed for both beginners and seasoned meditators, our app offers a unique experience to elevate your mindfulness practice.\n\nFeatures:\nSolfeggio Mixer.\nBGM Mixer.\nBGM uses spatial audio (3D sound) technology.\nSpatial audio creates an immersive experience by simulating sounds from all directions: above, below, around, behind you.\n\nWhy Solfeggio Frequencies?\nThese ancient sound frequencies are believed to promote healing, balance, and spiritual growth. Each tone resonates with different aspects of your well-being, helping you achieve deeper relaxation and focus.\"",
